msgid ""
"Field definition. Must include id, type. Accepts all Meta Box field "
"properties (e.g. options, std, placeholder, required, desc, clone, etc.). "
"See https://github.com/wpmetabox/schema/blob/main/field-group.json for full "
"schema."
